   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nigerian Development Partners&#x2019; Group (NDPG) Secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Nigeria Development Partners Group (NDPG) was set up by bilateral and multilateral development partners having presence in the country. The main objective of NDPG is to better facilitate coordination among Nigerian development partners. In addition, the NDPG also focuses in improving OfficialDevelopment Assistance (ODA) in line with development aid effectiveness principles encapsulated in the Paris Declaration for Aid effectiveness (2005), the Accra Agenda for Action (2008) and the Busan Par</narrative>
